      "translationZh": "返回新闻 2026年9月18日",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f227c48d59e8fcc2",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "def12ff8170a17d7",
      "translationZh": "宣布 SpaceXAI 最新的语音转文本模型，具有无与伦比的准确性和成本效益。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c65eeeb39ce9bd2",
      "translationZh": "今天我们发布 Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0，这是我们最新的语音转文本模型。在我们的真实世界评估中，Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 是目前最准确的转录模型之一，且在相同价格下的准确度是 Grok Voice Transcribe 1.0 的两倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "000ecfae28c8d68b",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 建立在 Grok Voice 后面的音频基础模型之上。Grok Voice 已经每天为数以万计的客户支持电话提供动力，转录数百万小时的视频旁白，并在实体产品中运行语音代理，包括特斯拉汽车中的 Grok 助手。它是在一个独特的数据集上训练的，该数据集包含在多样化环境中录制的实时、嘈杂、多语言音频，并通过后训练进行了精炼。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4f35358b9848424",
      "translationZh": "结果是一种在真实世界环境中语音的最准确转录模型之一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46c6318a59eec3a9",
      "translationZh": "大多数转录模型在干净的单说话人音频上表现良好。真实世界的音频更具挑战性：不稳定的电话线、竞争的声音、地方口音以及大声朗读的电话号码或电子邮件地址。我们为各种条件和环境下的最困难音频构建了 Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbe3f9b3691235d0",
      "translationZh": "在公开的 Artificial Analysis 排行榜上，Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 在 32 种流式模型中准确率排名第一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04a8c17e67e0bcb3",
      "translationZh": "右上方越好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e22e403be03186c9",
      "translationZh": "来源：Artificial Analysis",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a597fbb2346063f",
      "translationZh": "内部评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94b4bb93c40c089f",
      "translationZh": "除了公开基准外，我们在从生产流量中抽取的四个内部数据集上测量词错误率：来自客服电话的语音音频、与 Grok 的对话、诸如账户代码和电子邮件地址之类的口头凭据，以及简短的多语言语音命令。Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 在所有四个方面均优于 Grok Voice Transcribe 1.0，而在电话语音方面，它领先于我们测试的每个模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0191dba2c27819ec",
      "translationZh": "客服电话 · 英文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f59566b0578609c",
      "translationZh": "与 Grok 的对话 · 英文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ae0deec7587a05f",
      "translationZh": "电话号码、电子邮件、地址 · 英文",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07bc935945c7a193",
      "translationZh": "语音助手语句 · 19 种语言",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e7e34cc72d76f82",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 能转录数十种语言，自动检测语言，并在单次通过中跟随录音过程中的语言切换。多语言准确率是其相较于 Grok Voice Transcribe 1.0 的最大改进。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fd440489f5d4c47f",
      "translationZh": "转录准确率",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0db5de26a350b2db",
      "translationZh": "词错误率（%）。越低越好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5817f5e3309fb2b2",
      "translationZh": "Grok 语音转写 2.0",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ba12cef72147489",
      "translationZh": "诸如车内命令之类的短语给模型提供的语境很少，难以识别语言。在我们的短语集上，词错误率从 20.6% 下降至 6.8%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0751c3323397552",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 支持高级配置和控制。现有的 Speech-to-Text API 集成可在无需代码更改的情况下获得准确率提升：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cf1eb135481dfd7",
      "translationZh": "批处理和流式。转写录入文件和 URL，或实时转写音频流。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e182089c33a2d2d5",
      "translationZh": "词级时间戳。每个词具有精确的开始/结束时间和置信度分数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce98d8981b20350d",
      "translationZh": "说话人分离。在转写中标记每个说话人，无额外费用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e741a0bf89cb7fae",
      "translationZh": "多通道转写。独立转写多达 8 个通道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04bd72814bc88d78",
      "translationZh": "关键词偏置。每次请求可传入最多 100 个领域术语，例如产品名称或医学词汇。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "413771eca7df819c",
      "translationZh": "文本格式化。数字、日期、货币、电话号码和电子邮件地址以书面形式返回。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ae0ec4c5486136e",
      "translationZh": "填充词删除。从转写中省略诸如 \"um\" 和 \"uh\" 之类的填充词。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a2c085e3f727c53",
      "translationZh": "智能转折检测。检测说话人轮次的结束点，以供语音代理使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "320d4ebe5ecbc47e",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice 为 Atlassian Loom 提供动力",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04aabd362776a45e",
      "translationZh": "Atlassian Loom 广泛用于录制和共享屏幕录制。Atlassian 发现 Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 比他们现有的解决方案在转录 Loom 视频时更准确。准确的转录文本打开了新的 AI 工作流程：在 Loom 中记录行动计划，将转录文本管道传入 Cursor，它就会直接进行代码更新。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "ba2c826ebb5097b2",
      "translationZh": "我们一直相信，推动工作前进的最佳方式是一次捕获上下文，让它随处流动。借助 Grok 为 Loom 的语音转文本提供动力，以及 Cursor 将其转化为代码，我们正在从上下文到代码闭合环路：记录你的意思，工作就会完成。这让我们得以窥见 AI 辅助开发的未来方向。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcd8e23ac561051b",
      "translationZh": "Sanchan Saxena，Atlassian 团队协作集合高级副总裁",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d09fd3a0501488e",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 的定价与 Grok Voice Transcribe 1.0 相同。批量转录每小时音频费用为 0.10，流式转录每小时费用为 0.20，包含说话人分离、时间戳和关键词。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f166d0b14f78bf5",
      "translationZh": "Grok Voice Transcribe 2.0 将很快成为 Speech-to-Text API 的默认选项，而 Grok Voice Transcribe 1.0 将在接下来的几周内被弃用。为了在过渡期间继续使用它，请固定 grok-voice-transcribe-1.0 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a3455ece8adb4a32",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 Grok Voice Transcribe 进行构建",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
